\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Accessories\">accessories</a>.</span></span> \n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background:#F0DC82\">Hardness\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background:#FFFACD\">12\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background:#F0DC82\">Base Value\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background:#FFFACD\"><span style=\"display: none;\">0000005500</span>5<span class=\"popup has&#95;tooltip with-icon basic\">pp<span class=\"mw-valign-super\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img src=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/thumb/Icon_tooltip.png/10px-Icon_tooltip.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"10\" height=\"8\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/Icon_tooltip.png 1.5x\" /></span></span><span class=\"popup tooltip left below\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><a href=\"/page/Currency\" title=\"Currency\">Platinum Piece</a></span></span>&#160;5<span class=\"popup has&#95;tooltip with-icon basic\">gp<span class=\"mw-valign-super\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img src=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/thumb/Icon_tooltip.png/10px-Icon_tooltip.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"10\" height=\"8\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/Icon_tooltip.png 1.5x\" /></span></span><span class=\"popup tooltip left below\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><a href=\"/page/Currency\" title=\"Currency\">Gold Piece</a></span></span>&#160;\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background:#F0DC82\">Weight\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background:#FFFACD\">\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background:#F0DC82\">Location\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background:#FFFACD\"><b><a href=\"/page/Special_event_items\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Special event items\">Special event items</a></b>, <a href=\"/page/Special_event_history#Trivia_Contest\" title=\"Special event history\">Trivia Contest</a>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background:#F0DC82\">Enchantments\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background:#FFFACD\">\n<ul><li><span class=\"popup has&#95;tooltip with-icon basic\"><a href=\"/page/Haggle\" title=\"Haggle\">Haggle +3</a><span class=\"mw-valign-super\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img src=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/thumb/Icon_tooltip.png/10px-Icon_tooltip.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"10\" height=\"8\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/Icon_tooltip.png 1.5x\" /></span></span><span class=\"popup tooltip wide left below\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><b><a href=\"/page/Haggle\" title=\"Haggle\">Haggle +3</a>:</b> Passive: +3 <a href=\"/page/Competence_bonus\" title=\"Competence bonus\">Competence bonus</a> to the <a href=\"/page/Haggle\" title=\"Haggle\">Haggle</a> skill.</span></span></li></ul>\n</td>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background:#FFFACD;\" rowspan=\"5\" align=\"center\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/page/File:Lawrence%27s_Robe_of_Trivial_Knowledge.png\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><img src=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/thumb/Lawrence%27s_Robe_of_Trivial_Knowledge.png/420px-Lawrence%27s_Robe_of_Trivial_Knowledge.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"420\" height=\"216\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/Lawrence%27s_Robe_of_Trivial_Knowledge.png 1.5x\" /></a></span>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background:#F0DC82\">Upgradeable?\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background:#FFFACD\">\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background:#F0DC82\">Description\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background:#FFFACD\"><i>A fine robe of flowing glamerweave. A note in an interior pocket reads, 'May your knowledge always prove as trivial as it did today. -LD</i>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background:#F0DC82\">Notes\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background:#FFFACD\">\n<p>Renamed to <a href=\"/page/Item:Robe_of_Trivial_Knowledge\" title=\"Item:Robe of Trivial Knowledge\">Robe of Trivial Knowledge</a> after Menace of the Underdark to remove the name Lawrence. As of Update 28.1.2 (or earlier) this item is now a cosmetic armor.<br /><br />\nSir Lawrence d'Deneith was an event host in the early years of the game.\n</p>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background:#F0DC82\">Tips\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background:#FFFACD\">\n<p class=\"mw-empty-elt\">\n</p>\n<ul><li><span style=\"background-color: initial; color: #FF0000;\"><span style=\"font-size: larger; font-weight: inherit;\"><i>This item cannot be fed to <a href=\"/page/Sentient_Weapon\" title=\"Sentient Weapon\">sentient jewels</a>.</i></span></span></li></ul>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260816223928\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [no‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.113 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.171 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 5313/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 29791/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 5437/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 36/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/200\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 2019/5000000 bytes\nExtLoops count: 13/150\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%  149.416      1 -total\n 95.92%  143.320      1 Template:Named_item\n 94.24%  140.810      1 Template:Named_Armor\n 87.37%  130.546     46 Template:IO\n 29.83%   44.567      1 Template:GameRevisionDates\n 29.04%   43.385      2 Template:Lamannia_picture\n 28.52%   42.619      2 Template:IsLamannia\n 27.93%   41.732      2 Template:IsSpeculation\n 27.29%   40.775      2 Template:InCategory\n 14.28%   21.341      4 Template:Popup\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key ddowiki:pcache:idhash:8676-0!canonical and timestamp 20260816223928 and revision id 686643. Rendering was triggered because: page-view\n -->\n</div>"
